          "text": "<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Thin, strong design</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Titanium construction designed to deliver our lowest profile, optimizing patient comfort<br>\n &nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Smooth finish for comfort</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Polished surfaces designed to minimize irritation, enhancing patient experience post-operatively<br>\n &nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Reliable biocompatibility</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Indicated for extended wear, our splints are cleared for use up to 6 weeks</span></p>\n",
